      "path": "src/trailmark/parsers/rust/parser.py",
      "reason": "Equivalent for the supported Rust AST: token trees start with a delimiter, so a name at index one cannot have :: before it. Qualified names in raw token trees have index at least two. Native macro_invocation nodes place a bare name at zero and end with a token_tree."
